# who, whois, count and where with nine players on. In the temple (3001): Decimus (warrior, level 10), Quintus
# (25), Heroic (51), Clansman (20, clan rom), Outlaw (18, a loner, KILLER and THIEF), Yeoman (5, rom) and Smokegod
# (60, an immortal mage). Sluggish (2) sneaks in the Temple Square (3005), in the same area. Unseen (5) is
# invisible, and no one here can see it.
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@connect quin
Quintus
psswrd
@return
@connect hero
Heroic
psswrd
@return
@connect clan
Clansman
psswrd
@return
@connect out
Outlaw
psswrd
@return
@connect yeo
Yeoman
psswrd
@return
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect slug
Sluggish
psswrd
@return
@connect unseen
Unseen
psswrd
@return
# Pupil has typed a name but not the password yet, so isn't playing.
@connect half
Pupil
@as dec
who
# Levels: one bound, two, upside down, and a third number.
who 20
who 1 20
who 20 1
who 1 20 30
who 51
# Immortals, a class, a race (and one no player has), a clan, any clan, and things that are none of those.
who immortals
who imm
who warrior
who mage
who human
who elf
who clan
who rom
who loner
who dragon
who foo
who warrior 1 20
who 'clan' human
whois
whois d
whois s
whois zz
whois CLANS
count
@as god
count
where
where hassan
where quintus
where sluggish
where zz
where fido
@as slug
where
where decimus
# Yeoman leaves, so count falls below the most seen today. (Yeoman has an Id of its own: quit closes every
# connection whose character shares the quitter's, and Decimus, Quintus, Heroic and Sluggish share Knocker's.)
@as yeo
quit
@as god
count
who
